{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>תשגה</b> — you will be considered like one who errs, if you constantly engage in love for her [your wife], and all the more so for another's wife. And this is what they said concerning one's wife: one who multiplies love for his wife and speaks with her constantly more than the measure is erring, for the love of a woman removes a man from the service of HaShem."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:07.138621215Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}